            <h3>Golden Rule: Always Consider Higher Requirement</h3>
            <p>Between KW Connected Load and Monthly Electricity Bill amount (₹), <strong>always select whichever yields the higher number of cards!</strong></p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="req-golden-pill">⚡ 3-Phase Meter = Add +1 Extra Card</div>
      </div>

      <!-- Section 1: Master Visual Requirement Table Stage -->
      <div class="req-table-stage">
        
        <!-- Table Column Headers -->
        <div class="req-table-header-bar">
          <div>🔌 KW Connection</div>
          <div>🧾 Monthly Bill Amount</div>
          <div>💳 Single Phase Cards</div>
